  "text": "### Know Your Customer (KYC)  \n**What We Need:**\n- Photo ID (UK Passport or Driving License)\n- Proof of address (utility bill, council tax, or bank statement)\n- Source of funds (if relevant)\n- Beneficial ownership (if account for company)  \n**Why It Matters:**\n- Regulatory requirement\n- Prevents fraud\n- Protects customer's account\n- Complies with AML regulations  \n---",
